<title>UK: Merrill adds 75 mln stg to July 2002 bond.</title>
<headline>Merrill adds 75 mln stg to July 2002 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue has been increased to 375 million stg from 300 million stg lead manager Merrill Lynch said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MERRILL LYNCH &amp; CO INC</p>
<p> AMT   *375 MLN STG   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN    +7.5 BP    PAY DATE    01.AUG.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.875    FULL FEES   0.175</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA+	 REOFFER    99.875</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  U.S.	TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  7.5 BP    PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF MTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>		LAUNCHED ORIGINALLY F0R 300 MLN STG ON 18.JUN.97</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
